{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2022-05-05 09:05:00', 'title': 'INTELSAT ADDS FURTHER INDUSTRY EXPERIENCE TO EXECUTIVE TEAM', 'text': "MCLEAN, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INTELSAT, OPERATOR OF THE WORLD'S LARGEST INTEGRATED SATELLITE AND TERRESTRIAL NETWORK AND LEADING PROVIDER OF INFLIGHT CONNECTIVITY, TODAY NAMED FOUR SEASONED AEROSPACE AND TECH LEADERS TO KEY FINANCIAL AND COMMERCIAL ROLES. ANTHONY (TOBY) O'BRIEN WILL BECOME INTELSAT'S NEXT CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER (CFO). BRINGING A WEALTH OF EXPERIENCE TO THE JOB, O'BRIEN MOST RECENTLY SERVED AS CORPORATE CFO FOR RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: RTX) AFTER A FIVE-YEAR STINT AS CFO FO"}